<title>USA: Ophir SD 72, Mont., won by Piper Jaffray.</title>
<headline>Ophir SD 72, Mont., won by Piper Jaffray.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray Inc said it won $2.095 million of Ophir School District No 72, Mont., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.40 percent.</p>
</text>
